     "name": "Sensor Sweep",
     "cost": "two-actions",
     "traits": [],
     "text": "The BMC Devastator scans a zone in sensor range. Invisible starships in the zone become concealed instead. Concealed starships in the zone are no longer concealed. Starships in the affected zone must attempt a DC 33 Fortitude save. On a failure, the BMC Devastator’s scanners tag the target, making it off-guard to the Devastator and all its allies in sensor range for 1 round. The Devastator can Sustain this effect."
    }
